trong... Is that even possible?",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"w","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","How is she going to achieve that?",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Right this way, ==SEX12== Tyrant. The core of the project lies just ahead.",0,""],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,0.52,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.8],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["cbg",0,-200.0,-100.0,1.35,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["se","se_009"],["w",1],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.8],["say","0","We reach the lab's deepest chamber. Empty cultivation tanks line the metal floor, radiating an eerie, sterile chill.",0,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"x","025","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","Darcia, what are these tanks for?",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,1.2],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",1],["show","avg2_985","a","002",null,-0.1,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Your Majesty. These tanks hold \"Psychic Fluid,\" a compound I synthesized using the Neo Solution.",0,""],["ctl","avg2_985","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Its magical properties allow any subject submerged within to form a partial mental link.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","A partial mental link... What's that got to do with the Intelligent Plants?",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,0.25,-0.26,1.2,null,null,"OutSine",0.7],["bg","view_secret_laboratory_a",0,1.5],["cbg",0,150.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",1],["ctl","avg2_985","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Your Majesty,